note: Image Library Example (Dev Build 6.1.1)
note: The Image library turns Base64 text into a picture in the console.

add library "Image"

note: Define an image using Base64 data (this is a tiny 1x1 red pixel PNG)
define 'red_pixel' as image "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mP8/5+hHgAHggJ/PchI7wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="

note: Check if the image exists
check if 'red_pixel' exists

note: Display the image
display image 'red_pixel'

note: Check for an image that doesn't exist
check if 'nonexistent' exists
